{
  "key": 5206,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Earl, I am!\n",
        "Wonderful are Pokémon, yes!\r",
        "Teach you I will to be a better Trainer!\r",
        "What you want to know?\n",
        "Want to be a winner is you? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Good! Teach you, I will!\n",
        "In battle, Pokémon top on list,\f",
        "the walking one, jump out first!\r",
        "Change order in list, make battle\n",
        "easy, maybe!\r",
        "More from me you want to hear? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "So, want to know how to raise\n",
        "Pokémon well? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Fine! Teach you, I will!\n",
        "If Pokémon come out in battle even\f",
        "briefly, some Exp. Points it gets.\r",
        "Keep out weak Pokémon,\n",
        "switch in battle quick!\r",
        "This way, weak Pokémon very\n",
        "strong become!\f",
        "More from me you want to hear? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "So, want to know how to\n",
        "battle well? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Fine! Teach you, I will!\n",
        "Pokémon have goods and bads\f",
        "because many types.\r",
        "High-level Pokémon not win always\n",
        "if bad types.\r",
        "Pokémon with good types\n",
        "for the foe, you choose.\f",
        "Smart battle, it is!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! Smart student you are!\n",
        "Nothing more do I teach!\r",
        "Good to Pokémon you must be!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m taking notes of the teacher’s\n",
        "lecture.\r",
        "I’d better copy the stuff on the\n",
        "blackboard, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I traded my best Pokémon to the\n",
        "guy beside me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? The Pokémon I just got is\n",
        "holding something!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "...Some Berries can restore a\n",
        "Pokémon’s health.\r",
        "Many other items can be held\n",
        "by Pokémon...\r",
        "It sure is tough taking notes..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon have what are called\n",
        "abilities!\r",
        "It seems that each kind of Pokémon has\n",
        "distinct abilities.\r",
        "They say these abilities come in handy\n",
        "in battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The blackboard explains Pokémon\n",
        "status changes in battle.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00013",
      "en_US": "Read which topic? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "If poisoned, a Pokémon steadily\n",
        "loses HP.\r",
        "The poison lingers after the battle,\n",
        "and HP is lost as you walk.\f",
        "To cure it, use an Antidote.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Paralysis reduces speed and may\n",
        "prevent movement.\r",
        "It remains after battle, so use\n",
        "a Parlyz Heal.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "If asleep, your Pokémon can use only\n",
        "certain moves, such as Sleep Talk and\f",
        "Snore.\r",
        "A sleeping Pokémon doesn’t wake up\n",
        "after battle.\f",
        "Wake it up with an Awakening.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "A burn consumes HP, little by little,\n",
        "and also reduces the Attack stat.\r",
        "A burn lingers after battle.\n",
        "Use a Burn Heal as the cure.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "If your Pokémon is frozen,\n",
        "it can’t do a thing.\r",
        "It remains frozen after battle.\n",
        "Thaw it out with an Ice Heal.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s this kid’s notebook...\r",
        "“Catch Pokémon using Poké Balls.\n",
        "Up to six can be in your party.”\r",
        "Keep reading? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "“Before throwing a Poké Ball, weaken\n",
        "the target first.”\r",
        "“A poisoned or burned Pokémon is\n",
        "easier to catch.”\r",
        "Keep reading? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "“Some moves may cause confusion.\n",
        "Confusion may make a Pokémon attack\f",
        "itself.”\r",
        "“Leaving battle clears up any\n",
        "confusion.”\r",
        "Keep reading? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "“People who catch and use Pokémon\n",
        "in battle are called Pokémon Trainers.”\r",
        "“They are expected to visit Pokémon\n",
        "Gyms and defeat other Trainers.”\r",
        "The next page is... Blank!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0560_T22R0301_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Boy: E-he-he...\n",
        "I haven’t written any more..."
      ]
    },
